  "Added U+20B9 (Indian rupee sign) for INR: the source lists the obsolete U+20A8 for INR.",
  "'codes' are the ISO 4217 codes the source associates with the symbol. They exist ONLY to map a currency already stored as a code (a config from before the symbol picker) to its symbol. They are never shown. Every code appears under exactly ONE symbol: XAF is under U+20A3 only (the source also lists it under FCFA, which therefore has no codes)."
